    {
      "id": "hQRpjVKMmezPOVjlx2Xjo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4154.103683491173,
      "y": 253.5483696311719,
      "width": 875.8695105014739,
      "height": 53.50743240188855,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Ra",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 641329567,
      "version": 1000,
      "versionNonce": 1904462580,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760570831955,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "O bloco de Decisão controla o laço de repetição. Ele continua enquanto houverem\ncaracteres para processar (index for menor que o tamanho da text).",
      "fontSize": 21.40297296075542,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "O bloco de Decisão controla o laço de repetição. Ele continua enquanto houverem caracteres para processar (index for menor que o tamanho da text).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "yFlS4ZhE4wsBG_aL1FMSc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5300.3329397624175,
      "y": 321.5714146091502,
      "width": 875.8695105014739,
      "height": 53.50743240188855,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1RaO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1445215732,
      "version": 1260,
      "versionNonce": 759739588,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760747566461,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Extrai o código numérico UTF-16 do caractere na posição index.\nExemplo:",
      "fontSize": 21.40297296075542,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Extrai o código numérico UTF-16 do caractere na posição index.\nExemplo:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9ytBMYtayML6klh0PNS-8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5312.121529391888,
      "y": 607.7025519245758,
      "width": 875.8695105014739,
      "height": 53.50743240188855,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1RaQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1855833676,
      "version": 1315,
      "versionNonce": 1063091268,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760747566461,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Soma a chave de deslocamento ao código numérico do caractere.\nSe a chave for 3 e o código for 65, o resultado é 68.",
      "fontSize": 21.40297296075542,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Soma a chave de deslocamento ao código numérico do caractere.\nSe a chave for 3 e o código for 65, o resultado é 68.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rkz2wzxZIILSjj146ezRN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5309.144586056427,
      "y": 943.5692850255891,
      "width": 875.8695105014739,
      "height": 26.753716200944275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1RaR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 876834676,
      "version": 1381,
      "versionNonce": 1382896580,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760747566461,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Converte o número resultante de volta em caractere Unicode.",
      "fontSize": 21.40297296075542,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Converte o número resultante de volta em caractere Unicode.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dihadziozqCKh947msX9s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5305.474131714071,
      "y": 457.3324115508715,
      "width": 875.8695105014739,
      "height": 26.753716200944275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1RaS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1609220940,
      "version": 1287,
      "versionNonce": 882260804,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760747566461,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Isso traduz o caractere em um número, uma representação digital binária.",
      "fontSize": 21.40297296075542,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Isso traduz o caractere em um número, uma representação digital binária.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "91SSOrHJsGPuzMWudfz5_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5318.7299275652895,
      "y": 785.9221621100478,
      "width": 875.8695105014739,
      "height": 26.753716200944275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1RaU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 666997876,
      "version": 1361,
      "versionNonce": 1077293764,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760747566461,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Isso cria uma mudança linear no valor do caractere.",
      "fontSize": 21.40297296075542,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Isso cria uma mudança linear no valor do caractere.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Bh5IngW1jO-G8E9GUd9Bi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4153.721228546063,
      "y": 336.9417711068031,
      "width": 920.0987795846667,
      "height": 26.753716200944275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Rc",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1642742737,
      "version": 1147,
      "versionNonce": 329000692,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760570849252,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "O código numérico do caractere atual é obtido usando text.charCodeAt(index).",
      "fontSize": 21.40297296075542,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "O código numérico do caractere atual é obtido usando text.charCodeAt(index).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PEpaxakRGmkjOQCzWMUPZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4157.639904658568,
      "y": 407.5123553631731,
      "width": 920.0987795846667,
      "height": 53.50743240188855,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1RcV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 354347263,
      "version": 1170,
      "versionNonce": 888681326,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760658736906,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "O valor do código numérico é deslocado (subtraído) pela key. Este é o passo de\ndescriptografia.",
      "fontSize": 21.40297296075542,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "O valor do código numérico é deslocado (subtraído) pela key. Este é o passo de descriptografia.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vmp4uDRL7ygvaa0-M_TPQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4150.225988037268,
      "y": 491.24289590443516,
      "width": 920.0987795846667,
      "height": 53.50743240188855,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Rcl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 360419807,
      "version": 1167,
      "versionNonce": 1815354700,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760570885727,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "O novo código numérico deslocado (shifted) é convertido de volta para um caractere, e\nesse caractere é concatenado à string encrypted.",
      "fontSize": 21.40297296075542,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "O novo código numérico deslocado (shifted) é convertido de volta para um caractere, e esse caractere é concatenado à string encrypted.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
